@startuml 使用案例1_1_動物列表瀏覽
title 使用案例1.1: 動物列表瀏覽流程

actor "使用者\n(訪客/會員)" as User
participant "Animals.vue" as AnimalsPage
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "MinIO" as Storage

== 1. 進入動物瀏覽頁面 ==
User -> AnimalsPage: 訪問「/animals」路由
activate AnimalsPage
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 初始化篩選條件\n(filters = 預設值)
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 檢查用戶登入狀態\n(authStore.user)

== 2. 載入動物列表 ==
AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: listAnimals(filters)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals\n?page=1&per_page=20
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 檢查 JWT Token (可選)
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 收集篩選參數\n(species, sex, status, region等)
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: list_animals(filters, user_id)
activate AnimalService

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 建立查詢基礎\n(status = PUBLISHED)
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用篩選條件\n(物種、性別、地區等)
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 排序(最新上架優先)
AnimalService -> DB: SELECT animals\nWHERE status='PUBLISHED'\nLIMIT per_page OFFSET offset
activate DB
DB --> AnimalService: animals[]
deactivate DB

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 載入關聯資料\n(images, shelter, owner)
AnimalService -> DB: 批次載入圖片\nSELECT * FROM animal_images
activate DB
DB --> AnimalService: images[]
deactivate DB

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 組裝分頁資訊\n(total, pages, current_page)
AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: {animals[], pagination}
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 200 OK\n{animals[], pagination}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> AnimalsPage: {animals[], pagination}
deactivate AnimalAPI

== 3. 顯示動物卡片 ==
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 渲染動物卡片列表
loop 每個動物
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示圖片、名稱\n物種、年齡、性別
    AnimalsPage -> Storage: 透過 CDN 載入圖片\n(image.url)
    Storage --> AnimalsPage: 圖片資料
end

AnimalsPage --> User: 顯示動物列表\n(20筆/頁)
deactivate AnimalsPage

== 4. 使用者互動操作 ==
alt 點選動物卡片
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選動物卡片
    AnimalsPage -> User: 導航至動物詳情頁\n(router.push)
else 點選分頁
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選下一頁
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 page 參數
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: 重新載入動物列表
else 點選加入關注 (需登入)
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選「關注」按鈕
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 檢查登入狀態
    note right
      未實現關注功能
      顯示「即將推出」提示
    end note
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 動物列表已載入並顯示
  2. 僅顯示 status = PUBLISHED 的動物
  3. 支援分頁瀏覽
  4. 圖片透過 CDN 快速載入
end note

@enduml
